OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FThis evening
OL,6,Fwill be cloudy with patchy rain in the
OL,7,Fwest, dry in the east. Rain will turn
OL,8,Fmore persistent across the west
OL,9,Fovernight but remaining dry in the
OL,10,Feast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FRain will clear away during
OL,13,Fthe morning. Then the rest of the day
OL,14,Fwill be mainly dry with sunny spells,
OL,15,Fa few light showers in the west.
OL,16,
OL,17,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FSunny
OL,18,Fspells and a few showers on Tuesday,
OL,19,Fthese mainly in the west. Scattered
OL,20,Fshowers on Wednesday. Early showers on
OL,21,FThursday otherwise dry.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
